  "capabilityNotes": {
    "questions": "Correct that Grok exposes no question reverse-RPC, but it does have a question tool: live probes (2026-08-03) show `ask_user_question` arriving as a session/update tool_call with _meta[\"x.ai/tool\"].kind == \"ask_user\" and rawInput.questions[] carrying question + options[].label/description. It does not block on a client answer \u2014 the call completes and the turn goes idle on its own \u2014 so it is displayable but not answerable over ACP.",
    "toolKind": "Grok omits ACP's tool_call.kind and states its own under _meta[\"x.ai/tool\"].kind (observed: search, edit, list, ask_user). It sends _meta on updates that name no kind, so a kind must not be cleared from one."
  }
